# Cori-Steel Cutter, played for real. Turn 5 Bot1 equips the Goblin at sorcery speed and it becomes a 2/2 with trample
# and haste. Turn 7 Bot1 casts two spells: the second is flurry's, so a 1/1 white Monk with prowess arrives and Bot1
# accepts the offer to move the Equipment onto it — which leaves the Goblin its printed 1/1 and makes the Monk a 2/2.

